    "viz_steps": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## After a READY save\nSAVE sends one short ping **straight from this search head** to the provider with the `derekaiping` command. **Anthropic** goes to `https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages` with a Claude model. No gateway or webhook. **PASS** means the provider replied. **FAIL** has the provider's reason in **Connection test** (for example HTTP 401 means the key was rejected).\n1. Pick the provider and model, enter the key, click **SAVE**.\n2. Splunk Cloud must allow outbound HTTPS from the search head to the provider host. If the reason says it cannot reach the provider, ask Splunk Support to allow it.\n3. Open **Derek+ Data Quality Agent**, review a finding, click **ASK**.\n**FAILED** setup means provider, model, key, or endpoint is missing. Pick **None** and SAVE to turn the provider off.",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
