        "markdown": "SAVE stores the key in KV Store collection `dq_agent_ai_config` on this search head. App updates do not overwrite it. The install package does not ship a live API key. HEC token secrets and webhook URLs still do not belong in this app. The key is read only by the search that calls the provider.",
